# .gitignore

```gitignore
# 先忽略所有文件和目录
*

# =========================
# 保留需要进入仓库的内容
# =========================

!/.gitignore

!/bakeup/
!/bakeup/**

!/skills/
!/skills/**

# =========================
# Python 虚拟环境
# =========================

/skills/.venv/
/skills/*/.venv/
**/.venv/

# =========================
# Python 缓存文件
# =========================

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd

# =========================
# 常见编辑器缓存
# =========================

**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# VSCode
**/.vscode/

# JetBrains
**/.idea/

# =========================
# Python 构建产物
# =========================

**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/

# pytest
**/.pytest_cache/

# mypy
**/.mypy_cache/

# Ruff
**/.ruff_cache/

# uv
**/.uv/

# Coverage
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
```

## 如果这些文件已经被 Git 跟踪

修改 `.gitignore` 后，需要清理 Git 索引：

```bash
git rm -r --cached .
git add .
git status
```

确认无误后提交：

```bash
git commit -m "fix gitignore rules"
```

## 验证规则是否生效

查看某个文件是否被忽略：

```bash
git check-ignore -v skills/transcribe-video/scripts/__pycache__/analyze.cpython-312.pyc
```

如果输出对应的 `.gitignore` 规则，说明已经生效。